{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIzL1RoZS1SZWNrb25pbmctJTI4MjAyMy0lMjkv","type":"series","name":"The Reckoning","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/zXSIWNCuLT4NugyC70RR4aRJSif.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/o2hC4ZIZBReZb53pvTPqXzpTclS.jpg","description":"The life of Jimmy Savile, a man who, for decades, became one of the UK’s most influential celebrities, but in death has become one of the most reviled figures of modern history following revelations of extensive and horrific abuse.\n\nEnded · First aired 9 Oct 2023 · United Kingdom · Language: English · 233 min\nStudio: ITV Studios · Network: BBC One\n\nComplete series. On your server: S1 4/4\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2023","genres":["Crime","Drama","English"],"videos":[{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIzL1RoZS1SZWNrb25pbmctJTI4MjAyMy0lMjkv.1.1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"episode":1,"released":"2023-10-09T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"In the early 60s, Jimmy Savile became famous as a DJ in the dance halls of Leeds and Manchester. He ran sell-out dances for young people - but was also able to exploit this position.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jTuNDOzzTTL6v1M0dyXR0bI4ew0.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIzL1RoZS1SZWNrb25pbmctJTI4MjAyMy0lMjkv.1.2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"episode":2,"released":"2023-10-10T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Now at the height of his fame, Savile engineers more opportunities for charity work to further conceal his abusive behaviour.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/po6qiKPUuM9AYT4trv9YogFQ5DM.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIzL1RoZS1SZWNrb25pbmctJTI4MjAyMy0lMjkv.1.3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"episode":3,"released":"2023-10-16T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Savile is asked to host Jim’ll Fix It. Now at the peak of hi